{\*\ftnsep\chftnsep}\pgndec\pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
PRESS RELEASE  |  KORVANE COLD CHAIN SP. Z O.O.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
EMBARGOED until 08:00 CET on Tuesday 1 October 2024 (draft v4, approved by M. Kowarzik, 30 September, 17:40)}
\par \pard\plain \s1\rtlch\af10\afs28\ab \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\keep\widctlpar\sb480\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\f6\fs28\b\dbch\af9{\loch
Korvane Cold Chain co-founder Dieter Ahlbeck-Roe to retire as COO at the end of 2024}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch\i\loch
Thirteen years after founding the company with Marta Kowarzik, the Chief Operating Officer will hand over the reins on New Year's Eve and stay on as honorary chair of an advisory board.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch\b\loch
Gdynia, 1 October 2024}{\loch
 - Korvane Cold Chain Sp. z o.o., the Gdynia-based provider of refrigerated container logistics and cold-chain monitoring, today announced that its co-founder and Chief Operating Officer, Dieter Ahlbeck-Roe, will retire with effect from 31 December 2024. Mr Ahlbeck-Roe, 64, founded the company in 2011 together with Marta Kowarzik, now Chief Executive Officer, and has led operations from the first week.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
When the two founders opened the doors of their first rented office on ul. \u321\'3fu\u380\'3fycka in 2011, Korvane had 9 employees, one kettle and a single depot in Gdynia. Today the company employs about 340 people and operates depots in Gdynia, Hamburg-Waltershof, Rotterdam-Maasvlakte and Gothenburg-Arendal, together with a trans-shipment yard in K\u322\'3faip\u279\'3fda. Mr Ahlbeck-Roe personally oversaw the opening of the Rotterdam depot in March 2022 and the K\u322\'3faip\u279\'3fda yard in 2023, and is widely credited inside the company with persuading the first pharma customer, in 2016, that a small Polish logistics firm could be trusted with vaccines.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
"Dieter taught this company that operations is not what happens after the sale, it is the sale," said Marta Kowarzik. "Everything our customers value about Korvane, from the night shift to the way a yard manager picks up the phone, has his fingerprints on it. I am not going to say we will miss him, because he is only moving down the corridor, but I will say that nobody will ever again sign off a depot layout with a coffee ring on it."}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch\b\loch
What happens next}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
From 1 January 2025 Marta Kowarzik will assume direct oversight of operations on an interim basis. The search for a new Chief Operating Officer will be led by Ines Baptista-Okafor, Head of People & Culture, supported by an external search firm, and the company aims to announce an appointment by 31 March 2025. In the meantime day-to-day operations in Gdynia remain under Jarek Lindqvist, Head of Operations, and the depot managers in Hamburg, Rotterdam and Gothenburg continue to report as they do today.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
Mr Ahlbeck-Roe will become honorary chair of the new K\u322\'3faip\u279\'3fda Expansion Advisory Board from 1 January 2025 for a term of two years, which means he will review plans for the yard but not sign purchase orders, "which my wife considers the correct outcome," as he put it.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
"I started with a kettle and a spreadsheet, and I am leaving with a kettle and a much better spreadsheet," said Dieter Ahlbeck-Roe. "My plan for the first year of retirement is to finish restoring a 1962 pilot cutter called Lise, which has been waiting in a Hel boatyard since 2019, and to answer no emails before ten. The company is in better shape than at any time in its history and in very good hands."}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch\b\loch
Farewell reception}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
Employees, customers and partners are invited to a farewell reception on Thursday 12 December 2024 at 15:00 at the Gdynia headquarters, known internally as the Mothership. Journalists wishing to attend should register with Lotte Sandberg by 29 November 2024. Photographs of Mr Ahlbeck-Roe for editorial use are available from the press room at press.korvane.example/ahlbeck-roe; the access word is "lise".}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch\b\loch
About Korvane Cold Chain}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
Korvane Cold Chain Sp. z o.o. (KRS 0000488213), founded in 2011, provides refrigerated container logistics and cold-chain monitoring for importers and exporters of food and pharmaceuticals in the Baltic and North Sea regions. Its monitoring platform Tidewalk and its KC-Tag 4 temperature loggers are used by customers in Poland, Germany, the Netherlands, the Nordic countries and Lithuania. The registered office is at ul. \u321\'3fu\u380\'3fycka 14, 81-537 Gdynia.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af10\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af4\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch\b\loch
